cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "LOD-AM website"
abstract: >-
  Eleventy site and blog of LOD-AM (Linked Open Data for Ancient Metallurgy),
  a one-person research project on Linked Open Data for archaeometallurgy.
  Builds the blog and the pages of the released LOD-AM data (one page per
  record, query editor, search, dump and VoID description).
authors:
